{"height": 9, "weight": 200, "base_experience": 70, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "attack", "value": 1}], "genus": "Martial Arts Pokémon", "capture_rate": 180, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 25, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["ground", "humanshape"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "コジョフー"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Kojofu"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "비조푸"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "功夫鼬"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Kungfouine"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Lin-Fu"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Mienfoo"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Mienfoo"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "コジョフー"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "功夫鼬"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Mienfoo"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["black", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies."}, {"versions": ["white"], "text": "They have mastered elegant combos. As they concentrate, their battle moves become swifter and more precise."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "They can often be seen in packs in the morning, slowly moving their bodies through a series of poses."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "They seclude themselves in the mountains and devote themselves to training. The form of their kicks and chops differs from pack to pack."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "In one minute, a well-trained Mienfoo can chop with its arms more than 100 times."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "Though small, Mienfoo’s temperament is fierce. Any creature that approaches Mienfoo carelessly will be greeted with a flurry of graceful attacks."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-ix": {"scarlet-violet": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/